  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Aioun El-Atrouss-Nioro Du Sahel Regional Road Project Linking Mauritania and Mali</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims at constructing 190 km long Aioun EI Atrouss _ Nioro du Sahel Road, linking the city of Aioun EI Atrouss (regional capital of Al Hodh Al Gharbi, Mauritania) to the city of Nioro du Sahel (Mali).  Many villages will be crossed by the road.  At the present time there is no improved trail between the two cities, but merely series of unimproved tracks. These tracks make up a maze within a corridor several kilometers wide.</narrative>
  </description>
